{"title":"Career Roadmap: Robotics Engineer","role":"Robotics Engineer","summary":"A Robotics Engineer designs, programs, integrates and maintains robotic systems that interact with the physical world.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Mechatronics Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in mechanical systems, electronics, control systems, robotics programming, sensors, actuators, computer vision and autonomous systems"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Robotics Engineer designs, programs, integrates and maintains robotic systems that interact with the physical world."},{"type":"p","text":"The field combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mechanical Engineering","Electronics","Control Systems","Embedded Systems","Programming","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial robots"},{"text":"Collaborative robots"},{"text":"Autonomous mobile robots"},{"text":"Warehouse robots"},{"text":"Medical robotics"},{"text":"Agricultural robots"},{"text":"Drones"},{"text":"Inspection robots"},{"text":"Humanoid robots"},{"text":"Defence and space robotics"},{"text":"Service robots"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Engineering + programming foundation"},{"text":"Mathematics, Mechanics, C/C++"},{"text":"Small Arduino/robot project"},{"text":"Ignoring mathematics"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Mechatronics systems"},{"text":"Electronics, Sensors, Mechanics"},{"text":"Line-following/robotic mechanism"},{"text":"Only assembling kits"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Robotics + control"},{"text":"Control Systems, Embedded Systems, ROS"},{"text":"Autonomous robot"},{"text":"Weak control/programmin